Notebook[{
Cell[TextData[{
  "Week 4   Projective Geometry\n",
  StyleBox["Incidence theorems",
    FontSize->24]
}], "Title"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Copyright] Dana Scott 1993/1997/1998",
    FontSize->16,
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["\nNotebook  last edited: ",
    FontSize->16],
  StyleBox["13 September 1998",
    FontSize->16,
    FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Subtitle"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["A Warning on Subscripts!", "Subsubsection",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Because ",
  StyleBox["Mathematica",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " treats a subscript such as  ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(a\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " as a functional compound ",
  StyleBox["Subscript[a,1]", "InlineInput"],
  ", we have to be ",
  StyleBox["very careful",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " about ",
  StyleBox["assignments",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ".  For example, consider the following results:"
}], "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(a = 5; a\_1\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(a =. ; a\_1\)], "Input"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "This makes sense \[LongDash] if you remember what a subscript is \
\[LongDash] but it is easy to forget.  The problem is that we ",
  StyleBox["need",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " subscripted leters to make formulae more ",
  StyleBox["readable",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ".  So we have to learn to live with the ",
  StyleBox["Mathematica",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " conventions. "
}], "Text"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Advice.",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "  Try to avoid mixing subscripted and unsubscripted expressions using the \
",
  StyleBox["same",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " letter in working through computations \[LongDash] especially symbolic \
computations where certain variables have to be kept free of values.  To \
clear ",
  StyleBox["single letters",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " \[LongDash] or any identifiers ",
  StyleBox["Mathematica",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " recognizes as having ",
  StyleBox["Symbol", "InlineInput"],
  " as a head \[LongDash] use the command:\n\t\t",
  StyleBox["ClearAll[a,b,c,...]", "InlineInput"],
  "  \nTo clear a ",
  StyleBox["particular",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " subscripted letter use the special assignment such as:\n\t\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(a\_2 =. \),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  "\nTo clear ",
  StyleBox["all",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " subscripted letters, use the command:\n\t\t",
  StyleBox["ClearAll[Subscript]", "InlineInput"],
  "\nTo see ",
  StyleBox["which",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " subscripted expressions have been assigned values, use:\n",
  StyleBox["\t\t?Subscript", "InlineInput"]
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 0]],

Cell["Some examples:", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(b\_3 = 15; b\_3\%3\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(\(?Subscript\)\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(a\_5 = 23; \(?Subscript\)\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(b\_3 =. ; \(?Subscript\)\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(b\_2 = 11; \(?Subscript\)\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(ClearAll[Subscript]; \(?Subscript\)\)], "Input"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Some Famous Theorems", "Section"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Review of PD and PE", "Subsection"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The definitions", "Subsubsection",
  Background->GrayLevel[1]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Definition.",
  StyleBox["  Suppose",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  " ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(ll == a\_1\ x + a\_2\ y + a\_3\ z\)]],
  "  ",
  StyleBox["is a given",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  " ",
  StyleBox["line",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[", and that",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  "   ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(pp == \(b\_1\) u + b\_2\ v + b\_3\ w\)]],
  "  ",
  StyleBox["is a given ",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  StyleBox["point",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[".  ",
    FontWeight->"Plain",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox["We define ",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  StyleBox["PD", "InlineInput"],
  StyleBox[" so that",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  "\n\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(PD[ll, pp] == {a\_1, a\_2, a\_3} . {b\_1, b\_2, b\_3}\n
        \t\t\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \  == \ \ 
        a\_1\ b\_1 + a\_2\ b\_2 + a\_3\ b\_3\)]]
}], "Text",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  Background->RGBColor[1, 1, 0]],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Note.",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "  In ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(PD[ll, pp]\)],
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  ", ",
  "the line has to come ",
  StyleBox["first",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " and the point ",
  StyleBox["second",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  "."
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 0]],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Definition.",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["  Suppose",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  " ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_1 == a\_1\ u + a\_2\ v + a\_3\ w\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ",   ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_2 == b\_1\ u + b\_2\ v + b\_3\ w\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ", and  ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_3 == c\_1\ u + c\_2\ v + c\_3\ w\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " are three given ",
  StyleBox["points",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ".  We defin",
  StyleBox["e ",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  StyleBox["PE", "InlineInput"],
  StyleBox[" so that",
    FontWeight->"Plain"],
  " \n\n\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[
        RowBox[{\(PD[PE[p\_1, p\_2], p\_3] == \), "|", 
          TagBox[
            TagBox[GridBox[{
                  {\(a\_1\), \(a\_2\), \(a\_3\)},
                  {\(b\_1\), \(b\_2\), \(b\_3\)},
                  {\(c\_1\), \(c\_2\), \(c\_3\)}
                  },
                RowSpacings->1,
                ColumnSpacings->3,
                RowAlignments->Baseline,
                ColumnAlignments->{Left}],
              (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> 2]&)],
            (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> TensorRank[ 
                Unevaluated[ 
                  
                  TableForm[ {{FE`Conversion`Private`a1, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`a2, FE`Conversion`Private`a3}, {
                    FE`Conversion`Private`b1, FE`Conversion`Private`b2, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`b3}, {FE`Conversion`Private`c1, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`c2, FE`Conversion`Private`c3}}, 
                    TableDepth -> 2]]]]&)], "|"}],
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " and thus\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[
        RowBox[{\(PE[p\_1, p\_2] == \), "\n", "\t\t   ", "|", 
          TagBox[
            TagBox[GridBox[{
                  {\(a\_2\), \(a\_3\)},
                  {\(b\_2\), \(b\_3\)}
                  },
                RowSpacings->1,
                ColumnSpacings->3,
                RowAlignments->Baseline,
                ColumnAlignments->{Left}],
              (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> 2]&)],
            (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> TensorRank[ 
                Unevaluated[ 
                  
                  TableForm[ {{FE`Conversion`Private`a2, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`a3}, {FE`Conversion`Private`b2, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`b3}}, TableDepth -> 2]]]]&)], "|", 
          " ", \(x - \), "|", 
          TagBox[
            TagBox[GridBox[{
                  {\(a\_1\), \(a\_3\)},
                  {\(b\_1\), \(b\_3\)}
                  },
                RowSpacings->1,
                ColumnSpacings->3,
                RowAlignments->Baseline,
                ColumnAlignments->{Left}],
              (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> 2]&)],
            (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> TensorRank[ 
                Unevaluated[ 
                  
                  TableForm[ {{FE`Conversion`Private`a2, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`a3}, {FE`Conversion`Private`b2, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`b3}}, TableDepth -> 2]]]]&)], "|", 
          " ", \(y + \), "|", 
          TagBox[
            TagBox[GridBox[{
                  {\(a\_1\), \(a\_2\)},
                  {\(b\_1\), \(b\_2\)}
                  },
                RowSpacings->1,
                ColumnSpacings->3,
                RowAlignments->Baseline,
                ColumnAlignments->{Left}],
              (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> 2]&)],
            (TableForm[ #, TableDepth -> TensorRank[ 
                Unevaluated[ 
                  
                  TableForm[ {{FE`Conversion`Private`a2, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`a3}, {FE`Conversion`Private`b2, 
                    FE`Conversion`Private`b3}}, TableDepth -> 2]]]]&)], "|", 
          " ", "z"}],
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]]
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[1, 1, 0]],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Note.  ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "For lines (",
  StyleBox["xyz",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "-forms) we use ",
  StyleBox["dual",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " statements."
}], "Text",
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 0]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "As a consequence of the above definition, we also have these special cases \
for computing ",
  StyleBox["PE", "InlineInput"],
  " on basis forms:"
}], "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(Outer[PE, {u, v, w}, {u, v, w}] // TableForm\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(Outer[PE, {x, y, z}, {x, y, z}] // TableForm\)], "Input"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The geometric interpretations", "Subsubsection",
  Background->GrayLevel[1]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "The algebraic operations are introduced in order to be able to express ",
  StyleBox["geometric relationships",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " and ",
  StyleBox["constructions",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ".  Here we list the geometric interpretations of the most basic \
combinations."
}], "Text"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["Interpretation.  ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "Suppose",
  StyleBox[" ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_2\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_3\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " are given ",
  StyleBox["lines",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_2\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_3\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " are given ",
  StyleBox["points",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ". Then we have:\n",
  StyleBox["(",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["i",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[")",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PD[l\_1, p\_1] == 0\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " if, and only if, point  ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " is ",
  StyleBox["on",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " line ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ".\n",
  StyleBox["(",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["ii",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[")",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PE[p\_1, p\_2] == \),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " the line ",
  StyleBox["joining",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_2\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ".\n",
  StyleBox["(",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["iii",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[")",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PE[p\_1, p\_2] == \ 0\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " if, and only if, ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(p\_2\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " represent the ",
  StyleBox["same",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " point.\n",
  StyleBox["(",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["iv",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[")",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PE[l\_1, l\_2] == \),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " the point at the ",
  StyleBox["intersection",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " of ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_2\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  ".\n",
  StyleBox["(",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["v",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[")",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PE[l\_1, l\_2] == \ 0\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " if, and only if, ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_1\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(l\_2\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " represent the ",
  StyleBox["same",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " line.\n",
  StyleBox["(",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["vi",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[")\t",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PD[PE[p\_1, p\_2], p\_3] == 0\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " if, and only if, the points are ",
  StyleBox["collinear",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ".\n",
  StyleBox["(",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["viii",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  StyleBox[")",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "\t",
  Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[\(PD[l\_1, PE[l\_2, l\_3]] == 0\),
        FontWeight->"Bold"]]],
  " if, and only if, the lines are ",
  StyleBox["concurrent",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  "."
}], "Text",
  TextAlignment->Left,
  Background->RGBColor[0, 1, 1]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "From time to time, we also interpret projective points and lines in the ",
